#   domain challenges/10_shortest_path.domain
Cursed Energy: 10_shortest_path.input
Shikigami: Digit Grid
Domain Expansion: Dijkstra from 0 0
Cursed Technique: Apply
    Using: (g) -> at(g, 9, 9)
Reveal: stdout
